 ### Image Guidelines

 #### Aspect Ratios
 ```css
 /* Standard Aspect Ratios */
 .aspect-square { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }    /* 1:1 - Avatars, thumbnails */
 .aspect-video { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }    /* 16:9 - Hero images */
 .aspect-portrait { aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; }  /* 3:4 - Profile photos */
