   font-size: 0.875rem;
   color: var(--gray-500);
   text-align: center;
   padding: 2rem;
 }
 ```

 **Implementation Notes:**
 1. Show loader when fetching next page
 2. Show "No more results" when end reached
 3. Trigger fetch when user scrolls to 80% of content
 4. Debounce scroll events (300ms)

