 ### Confirmation Patterns

 #### When to Show Confirmation Dialog
 ✅ **Always confirm:**
 - Permanent deletions
 - Cancelling bookings with payments
 - Removing users/technicians
 - Irreversible actions

 ❌ **Don't confirm:**
 - Saving changes (expected action)
 - Adding items (reversible)
 - Opening modals
 - Navigation

